Mon Oct 12 18:33:13 UTC 2026 - Tomáš Chvátal <tomas.chvatal@gmail.com>

- Extend tarix-fuse3.patch with -D_FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64 for the
  fuse_tarix build: libfuse3 requires a 64-bit off_t, so the
  build failed on 32-bit targets (i586, armv7l)
- Add tarix-pax-headers.patch: keep POSIX pax extended headers
  attached to the archive member they describe when extracting.
  They were matched against the file list on their own before,
  so filtered extractions leaked the headers of excluded
  members and tar applied them to the wrong member
- Run the full upstream testsuite in %check: the pax header fix
  makes 08-exclude pass with the POSIX tar format that openSUSE
  uses by default, so failures are no longer ignored there

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Jun 22 11:02:52 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Add tarix-fuse3.patch: port the FUSE filesystem (fuse_tarix) from
  libfuse2 to libfuse3 (boo#1242192) - bump FUSE_USE_VERSION to 31,
  update the getattr/readdir operation signatures and fuse_fill_dir_t
  calls for the fuse3 API, and build against pkg-config fuse3
- Switch BuildRequires from pkgconfig(fuse) to pkgconfig(fuse3)

